{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL090aGVyc19MYW5ndWFnZS9DaGluZXNlLU1vdmllcy9UaGUlMjBUcmVhc3VyZSUyMEh1bnRlciUyMCUyODIwMDklMjkv","type":"movie","name":"The Treasure Hunter","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/hHF1pLZLHSs5Yf72LgADx00I0j5.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/tdidYPYIH2MzafaMw1B1bLkexoB.jpg","description":"In the northwest desert where countless prosperous dynasties have flourished and fallen, there is rumor of a treasure of unbelievable riches buried among it. A group of mysterious guardians have been guarding the map to the location of the treasure until a fierce rivalry erupted. A notorious international crime group, The Company hunted down the map keeper and before they managed to secure the map, the keeper passed the map to a young chivalrous man Ciao Fei. Ciao Fei was forced to give up the map to save the live of his mentor’s daughter Lan Ting. Teaming up with Hua Ding Bang and Lan Ting they embark on a dangerous journey to recover the map and fight to protect the ancient treasure.","releaseInfo":"2009","genres":["Action","Adventure","Fantasy","Science Fiction","Others"],"imdbRating":"3.6","runtime":"105 min","cast":["Jay Chou","Lin Chi-ling","Chen Daoming","Baron Chen","Miao Pu","Ian Powers","Kenneth Tsang","Eric Tsang Chi-wai"],"director":["Kevin Chu"],"released":"2009-12-09T00:00:00.000Z","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Jay Chou","character":"Qiao Fei","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/7kQYk466uzk58BrzPBHFyniRt7Q.jpg"},{"name":"Lin Chi-ling","character":"Lan Ting","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/AjgEOswkQQRJQ7LikPQ1o8fO0fN.jpg"},{"name":"Chen Daoming","character":"Master Hua","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/xu5PRp6umslrXMvnq0pWsa5LnQh.jpg"},{"name":"Baron Chen","character":"Desert Eagle","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/cIC1Erx4W8A7b7WwcrtqpQ0Ue3l.jpg"},{"name":"Miao Pu","character":"Swords Thirteen","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/qC1Na8zzLfefZQ4hC6kc4